<title>USA: Sioux City cattle steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City cattle steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers steady to weak in a thin test of Choice grade. Slaughter cows $2.00-$3.00, mostly $2.00 higher. Slaughter bulls steady to $1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
</text>
